1
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,680
Lady, your lyrics

2
00:01:53,039 --> 00:01:54,840
and unique melodies

3
00:01:55,039 --> 00:01:56,520
are truly exquisite.

4
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,729
You flatter me, sister.

5
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:01,800
What does Miss Zhao think?

6
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,039
Perhaps

7
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,960
she was so immersed in it

8
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:13,760
that she couldn't come back to her senses for a moment.

9
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,880
Is that so?

10
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:18,400
Just as Auntie said.

11
00:02:19,079 --> 00:02:20,720
My niece has been ill for a long time

12
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:22,000
and is often weak.

13
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:24,840
Why don't we let her go down and rest first,

14
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:26,610
and we two sisters can catch up.

15
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:27,890
That's fine.

16
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:30,880
I need to prepare to welcome that person too.

17
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:31,920
It's just that

18
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:34,090
my Fan Restaurant is a bit special.

19
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,280
Miss Zhao,

20
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,090
it's best not to run around.

21
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:39,800
Yes.

22
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:02,200
Walk slowly, Your Majesty.

23
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,460
Be careful not to fall.

24
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,380
Be careful, Your Majesty.

25
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:48,000
Director Chu.

26
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:50,760
My Lord.

27
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,560
Director Chu,

28
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,960
is everything ready?

29
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:05,010
Just one letter.

30
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,080
One is enough.

31
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:12,040
Lady Zhao has a good plan.

32
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,240
The contents of this letter, between the lines,

33
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:17,640
are full of praise for the Crown Prince's diligence and kindness.

34
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:20,960
Normally, it would be fine if His Majesty saw it,

35
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,400
but tonight,

36
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:26,480
these words will be deadly.

37
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,650
This is Cui Hong's confession.

38
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,960
It details

39
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,000
how he was instructed

40
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,159
by Hu Yu of the Military Introduction Office

41
00:05:37,159 --> 00:05:39,000
to frame me.

42
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:41,680
He has signed and fingerprinted it.

43
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,010
As for Cui Hong himself,

44
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,850
I have detained him.

45
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,000
If His Majesty needs,

46
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:48,780
he can be summoned at any time.

47
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:53,159
Hu Yu of the Military Introduction Office,

48
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:55,130
Liang Shicheng's adopted son.

49
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,120
Exactly.

50
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,159
I see.

51
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,280
But Director Chu,

52
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,760
please remember,

53
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,640
all I can do to help you

54
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:06,880
is to say a few soothing words when His Majesty is furious.

55
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:09,840
I can't care about anything else,

56
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:10,840
nor say anything.

57
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,540
Do you understand?

58
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,640
I will keep it in mind.

59
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,610
If the matter fails,

60
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,650
it has nothing to do with Lord Zhou.

61
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:19,960
If it succeeds,

62
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,330
and His Majesty rewards us,

63
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,320
naturally,

64
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,730
Lord Zhou will be credited.

65
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:29,370
Then let's proceed according to the plan.

66
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,160
Yes.

67
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:53,680
Excellent.

68
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:56,260
What a 'green is fat, red is thin'.

69
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:57,520
Wonderful.

70
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:58,600
Wonderful.

71
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,200
Thank you, Your Majesty.

72
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:04,600
Your Majesty, would you like some fruits and wine?

73
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:06,680
Your Majesty,

74
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:10,120
this wine today was brewed by the owner of Fanlou himself.

75
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,800
After I tasted it myself,

76
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:15,480
I recommended it to the eunuch for inspection and presentation.

77
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,340
You are very thoughtful, Shishi.

78
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:29,560
There's something strange about the wine.

79
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:31,160
It smells like rotting meat.

80
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,440
Your Majesty.

81
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,560
There is something wrong with this wine.

82
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,760
You must not drink it.

83
00:07:42,200 --> 00:07:42,930
How dare you!

84
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:44,880
I, your guilty servant,

85
00:07:44,880 --> 00:07:46,920
former Chief of Bingjing Affairs Chu Sanniang,

86
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,640
knowing Fanlou is in danger tonight,

87
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,570
have come to protect Your Majesty.

88
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,360
I deserve death.

89
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:56,120
Fanlou is heavily guarded tonight.

90
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:58,680
I have not heard of any danger.

91
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,120
Your Majesty.

92
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,600
The day before yesterday, I found ironclad evidence

93
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:19,120
that assassins intended to ascend Fanlou on the night of the Lantern Festival and plot treason.

94
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:21,920
I have been doing my best to track down the assassins.

95
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:24,240
However, I was suddenly framed and convicted.

96
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,920
I have not been able to find out clearly

97
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,180
who the assassins are.

98
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:28,520
Right now,

99
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:32,090
I also do not know where they will strike from.

100
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,159
Your Majesty,

101
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,159
please prioritize your health

102
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:38,640
and leave Fanlou first.

103
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:40,520
Forget it.

104
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,799
Return to the palace.

105
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,200
Give me your life, Emperor.

106
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,440
Protect His Majesty.

107
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,200
Han'er, this...

108
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:03,720
Taoist Master.

109
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,320
Meng Qian,

110
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:05,860
escort His Majesty first.

111
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:06,920
Your Majesty.

112
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:13,840
Starring (sorted by strokes of surname)

113
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:13,960
Special Appearance (sorted by strokes of surname)
